{
  "_comment": [
    "Scenario: UC-03-01 daytime bayshore traffic-jam monotony drive.",
    "Derived from uc02_monotony_v0_1; tuned to fire the monotony channel of",
    "aica_transparent_hybrid_trigger_v1 on the short 6.9 km Funabashi-Makuhari",
    "route when the whole route is painted as a slow traffic jam.",
    "",
    "Design (combined_contracts task-5-round1 fix):",
    "  - traffic_jam_kph lowered to 3 kph so the 6.9 km route crawls for ~141 min",
    "    (47 ticks at 0.15 km/tick), giving the hybrid's mono_min accumulator",
    "    ~140 min of monotonous-segment exposure before completion.",
    "  - Hybrid monotony_prevention_score at saturation (mono_min>=90 min):",
    "      0.4*1.0 + 0.3*0.5(jam env) + 0.2*1.0(familiar) = 0.75 >> 0.70 threshold.",
    "  - monotony_add_per_min raised 0.05->0.15 so drowsiness grows slightly faster",
    "    under monotony, but with initial_state 5/5 and dead-band at 60, drowsiness",
    "    stays far below 60 for the whole run (5 + 141*0.28/min ~= 44.5) -- the",
    "    hybrid's fatigue/drowsiness features stay low and rest_required never fires.",
    "  - is_night=false (daytime Saturday drive, per persona).",
    "  - familiar_route=true (monthly mall trip, per persona).",
    "  - Scenario presets carry the jam event directly (start_min:0, duration:200 min)",
    "    so no jam_range_km override is needed from the test case."
  ],
